qore-amqp-module (1.0.0~git20260928.1-0qore1~ubuntu26.04) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Package native bindings, two compiled/source helpers, metadata,
    resources/translations, API docs, test examples and debug symbols.
  * Use the distribution Qpid Proton C++ library without downloads.
  * Match the CMake minimum to COPY_FILE and declare AmqpUtil dependencies.
  * Supply the documentation footer, correct tag paths and Qdx environment,
    and convert API tables to Qore format.
  * Apply custom TLS trust/client identity settings with sandbox file checks.
  * Record explicit QUnit skips when no integration broker is configured.
  * Add installed runtime/compiler tests and reproducible offline profiles.

